The '''Sheep Watch''' is a [[:Category:Difficulty 1|difficulty 1]] [[Dungeons|dungeon]] that is started by clicking on the gate in the [[Southern Wilds|southwest Wilds]], near [[Farnum's Farm]]. There is an icon on the [[Atlas]] for the Sheep Watch.

==Mobs==
===[[Non-Playable-Character|NPCs]]===
*Sheep

===[[:Category:Enemies|Enemies]]===
*Wolves

===[[Boss|Bosses]]===
*Alpha Female Wolf
*Alpha Male Wolf

==Goals==
:Defeat all the wolves

==Rewards==
:122 Stars
:Members Only Bonus: 51 Coins

